:"自分もも女の子なのに、同棲のちょっとした仕草にドキドキしてしまい、女の子と男の子、どちらの自分が本物なのかが現在の悩みの種。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5570","sourceWorkId":"20875","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公にしてヒロイン。 女の子として生まれてきたが、心の中に男の子としてのもう一人の自分がいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その人格は今まで、彼女が必要とした時 自動的に現れていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし第二次成長を経て思春期を迎えた今、その人格は暴走気味に現れてしまうようになっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どちらの自分が本物なのか、それが現在の悩みの種。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29944"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"sex":[{"comparisonValue":"b","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c26404","value":"b"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5570","value":"女性"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5570","value":"女性"},{"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29944","value":"女 / 男"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0d2bdef551c89d84ec9ce4f3f671456983c9acb07dcab53d4907ade57abeb8a8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/77/775219251758a80a87718da2bf6a87a080c4c5e40474fd7961abf71be4757497.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"間宮菜南子","creatorId":"vndb:s999","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s999","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s999","name":"間宮 菜南子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:109460:29944:15995:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c26405","characterName":"百合ヶ丘 七海","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29945","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"109460"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5571"],"vndbCharacterId":"c26405"},"originalCharacterName":"百合ヶ丘 七海","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mutsuki's younger twin sister. Because of their parents divorce was raised separately from her twin. Because of this she has a hard time trusting others, especially her twin sister. She enjoys swimming and often sneaks into the pool at night to swim nude."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c26405"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"睦月の双子の妹。両親の離婚によって母方に引き取られた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃は姉にベタベタだったが、離婚のいざこざで引き離されてから達観してしまったのかクールで皮肉めいた性格になった(装っているだけ)。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だがペースを乱されると弱い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉に捨てられたという思いがあり、少々ヒネている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"傷つくのがイヤで、人を好きにならないでいようと決めているが、甘えん坊の根は変わっていない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5571","sourceWorkId":"20875","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"睦月の双子の妹。 両親の離婚によって母方に引き取られた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"離婚のいざこざ以降 達観してしまったところがあり、実際の年齢より年上に見られることが多くなった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃は姉にベタベタの甘えたさんだったが、今はクールで皮肉めいた性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉に捨てられたという思いがあり、少々ヒネている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも本を読んでいて、歌がうまい。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29945"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bfeeeb162cd598a7455ab54d65e64e858c09543cddef65ea8ee76331c8eedbca.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/48/48489931cc30a53f63ef312f160ab2b3a661cca268a3405745790ba8fa24d235.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"八ッ橋きなこ","creatorId":"vndb:s353","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s353","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s353","name":"八ッ橋きなこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:109460:29945:16170:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c26406","characterName":"荒垣 晶","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29946","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"109460"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5572"],"vndbCharact