","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"後輩に慕われる上級生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クールでカッコいいが、手癖が悪く泣かせた後輩は数知れず。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"享楽的な刹那主義者。人間ができているように見えるのがタチが悪い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5578","sourceWorkId":"20875","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"後輩に慕われる上級生。 クールでカッコいい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"が、手癖が悪く泣かせた後輩は数知れず。 享楽的な刹那主義者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やさしそうに見えて、自分の思い通りにならないことは認めない女王様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間が出来ているように見えるのがタチが悪い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29953"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bc/bc9bfd64ad2b28c9980e024536263243a7e60256faf1a3ccf60fdc698512ec03.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2f/2f72851facc9a3ec4e31b25e327c6e3b0279cfc4aacf3798edeefbcedc3bd679.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"夏野虹花","creatorId":"vndb:s3218","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3218","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3218","name":"夏野虹花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:109460:29953:15736:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c26413","characterName":"鈴鳴 鈴子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29954","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"109460"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5579"],"vndbCharacterId":"c26413"},"originalCharacterName":"鈴鳴 鈴子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"親しみやすいため、静佳とは別の意味で後輩に慕われる先輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現寮長。一見優等生だが、実際は面倒くさがりでだらしないなどオンオフが激しいタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大ざっぱだが包容力があるので、後輩や同級生には信頼されている。基本は優等生なので大人たちからの信任も篤い。なんだかんだで〆るところでは〆てくれる。通称「りんごちゃん先輩」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5579","sourceWorkId":"20875","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"現寮長。 通称・林檎ちゃん先輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親しみやすいため、静住とは別の意味で後輩に慕われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見優等生だが、実際は面倒くさがりでだらしないところがある。 ON/OFFが激しいタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大雑把だが包容力があるので、後輩・同級生には信頼されている。 基本は優等生なので大人たちからの信任も厚い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なんだかんだで、締めるところでは締めてくれる頼りになる人。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29954"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a3/a349a74881f312b91e56e869e55e3cd7a5f34a57f0acf0ab6c9b432c05ea3732.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d9/d94cca409ff02d424ed6a9a5788711987b33c3a91374b5ede8a82978340b7167.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"妃咲みぁ","creatorId":"vndb:s8215","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8215","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8215","name":"妃咲 みぁ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:109460:29954:17676:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c26414","characterName":"ゆうちゃん","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29950","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"109460"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5576"],"vndbCharacterId":"c26414"},"originalCharacterName":"ゆうちゃん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスメイトで庶民。ひたすらドジなメガネっ娘だが、とにかく一生懸命なので愛されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"睦月へ過剰に憧れていてちょっと怖いくらい。一歩間違えればヤンデレさん。スキンシップ過剰で同じ部屋になったときはベッドに潜り込んできたりする。"},{"spoiler":fals